{
  "info": {
    "name": "HealthCure - CardioPredict API",
    "description": "Coleccion completa de endpoints para probar la API de HealthCure.\n\nPASOS PARA USAR:\n1. Levanta el servidor: uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000\n2. Importa esta coleccion en Postman (File - Import)\n3. IMPORTANTE: No necesitas crear un Environment - las variables son de coleccion\n4. Haz clic en \"Login - Obtener Token\" (admin o medico)\n5. El token se guarda automaticamente\n6. Todos los demas requests usan el token automaticamente\n\nCredenciales de prueba:\n  Admin:   admin@healthcure.com / admin123\n  Medico:  dr.garcia@healthcure.com / doctor123",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check - Verificar servidor",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Verifica que el servidor este funcionando. No requiere autenticacion."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Servidor funcionando (200)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    var r = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(r.status).to.eql('ok');",
                  "    console.log(r.app + ' v' + r.version);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth - Autenticacion",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1 - Login Admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@healthcure.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Login como admin. El token se guarda automaticamente para TODOS los requests de la coleccion."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var response = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Login admin exitoso (200)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(response.access_token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(response.usuario.rol).to.eql('admin');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (response.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', response.access_token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_id', response.usuario.id);",
                  "    console.log('Token guardado - admin: ' + response.usuario.nombre);",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.log('No se obtuvo token - revisa credenciales');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2 - Login Medico",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"dr.garcia@healthcure.com\",\n  \"password\": \"doctor123\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Login como medico. Reemplaza el token de admin con uno de usuario normal."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var response = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Login medico exitoso (200)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(response.access_token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(response.usuario.rol).to.eql('usuario');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (response.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', response.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('Token guardado - medico: ' + response.usuario.nombre);",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.log('No se obtuvo token - revisa credenciales');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login - Credenciales invalidas",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@healthcure.com\",\n  \"password\": \"wrong_password\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Prueba de login con contrasena incorrecta. Debe retornar 401."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Error 401 - Credenciales invalidas', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Registrar Usuario Nuevo (publico)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Dra. Maria Torres\",\n  \"email\": \"dra.torres@healthcure.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"rol\": \"usuario\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Registra un usuario nuevo. Aunque envies rol: admin, siempre se crea como usuario (seguridad)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Registro exitoso (201)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "    var response = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(response.nombre).to.eql('Dra. Maria Torres');",
                  "    pm.expect(response.rol).to.eql('usuario');",
                  "    pm.expect(response).to.not.have.property('password_hash');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Mi Perfil - /me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "me"]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Obtiene los datos del usuario autenticado. Requiere token JWT."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Perfil obtenido (200)', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    var response = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(response).to.have.property('email');",
                  "    pm.expect(response).to.not.have.property('password_hash');",
                  "    console.log(response.nombre + ' (' + response.email + ') - rol: ' + response.rol);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Mi Perfil - Sin token (debe fallar)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Prueba de acceso sin token. Debe retornar 401."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Error 401 - No autenticado', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
